  "details": "I don't know if there would be any automated way to do this, but at least letting world and avatar creators upload lower resolution textures and meshes would be great for the performance. If its possible automatically... thats even better than. Then you would have a slider, swich or curve in the settings for when to decimite (and how much) the models and scale the textures. \n\nEDIT: Just found out, that what I was suggesting here is basically a automatic or manual (if not already possible) LOD (Level of detail) setting.\n\n-\n\nalso possibly interisting for performance:\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/feature-requests/p/settings-for-lighting-eg-completely-disableno-shadows-etc\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/feature-requests/p/general-draw-distance-setting-for-worlds-and-avatars",
